title: "Amazon Business Entity Resolution: Production-Grade ML Entity Matching Pipeline"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
url: "https://github.com/uvpatel/amazon-hackathon"
repository-code: "https://github.com/uvpatel/amazon-hackathon"
abstract: "A high-precision, scalable entity resolution pipeline built for the Amazon ML Challenge 2026. Resolves millions of noisy commercial business records across three disparate data sources without common identifiers, utilizing a multi-rule inverted index candidate generator and HistGradientBoostingClassifier optimized for Macro F0.5."
